Z||000018||sloth85GT||08-09-2001||02:21 AM||||Well of course you get your typical war, heck I started one myself before I really got familiar with this site, and I was in a bad mood. BUT at no point did I ever knock anyone elses Fiero. I love the cars. But the best part is the way that everyone helps each other out with parts and such. For example, there was this younger guy on here asking for some free parts, and tons of guys were willing to help out. That was great. And now Sqoach is now gonna hook me up with a wing for nothing but shipping costs. Although I may toss in something a little extra  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">. And it's not all guys either, there's the women in here too. FIERO GIRL POWER! The only thing better than a Fiero is a cute girl driving a Fiero. I love to see women with such a love for their cars. All in all, this is the best place for Fiero owners to come together and help each other out. <P>And thanks to mrgone for the compliment on my car.<P>Thanks to Cliff for setting this up, he is my new god. And as Bluebottlejunky put it, Pennock Fiero Forum = My Bible!!!<P>Cliff? 4 words.........I LOVE YOU MAN!!!!! hehehe<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.mts.net/~kuzma/fieronl.gif"> <BR>Dan<BR>1985 Silver GT||||reg||12
